data-group="Pac-12" data-status="One or more losses" id="program-boise-state"><span class="rank">23</span><p class="meta">AP No. 23 · Coaches Receiving votes</p><h3>Boise State</h3><span class="tag">Pac-12 · 4-1</span><p>The Broncos beat Utah State 37-18 in their first Pac-12 conference game. A 21-0 start and six sacks helped establish control.</p><dl><dt>Latest result</dt><dd>2026-10-03 · W 37–18 home vs Utah State</dd><dt>AP movement</dt><dd>Down 1</dd><dt>Next game</dt><dd>2026-10-10 · away vs Fresno State</dd></dl><details><summary>Conference start secured · analysis</summary><p>The conference transition began well. Road results will be central to keeping a national ranking.</p><p><strong>Watch next:</strong> Fresno State is the next conference road test.</p><p class="source-ref">Sources: <a href="https://broncosports.com/news/2026/10/3/football-broncos-earn-first-pac-12-conference-victory">Boise State defeats Utah State ↗</a></p></details><p class="source-ref">Sources: <a href="https://www.ncaa.com/news/football/article/2026-10-04/top-five-holds-alabama-rises-latest-ap-top-25-college-football-rankings">October 4 AP Top 25 table ↗</a> · <a href="https://www.afca.com/missouri-bounces-back-with-dominant-win/">October 4 US LBM Coaches Poll ↗</a></p></article><article class="card" data-card data-group="ACC" data-status="One or more losses" id="program-smu"><span class="rank">24</span><p class="meta">AP No. 24 · Coaches No. 21</p><h3>SMU</h3><span class="tag">ACC · 4-1</span><p>SMU beat Boston College 25-16 in rain despite finishing with 218 total yards. The Mustangs have won twice since losing at Louisville.</p><dl><dt>Latest result</dt><dd>2026-10-03 · W 25–16 home vs Boston College</dd><dt>AP movement</dt><dd>Down 3</dd><dt>Next game</dt><dd>2026-10-17 · home vs Virginia</dd></dl><details><summary>Winning without polish · analysis</summary><p>The defense helped protect the result. More efficient offense is the clearest route to a firmer ranking.</p><p><strong>Watch next:</strong> An open week precedes Virginia, followed by Cal at home.</p><p class="source-ref">Sources: <a href="https://smumustangs.com/news/2026/10/3/football-no-21-smu-defeats-boston-college-in-the-rain-25-16">SMU defeats Boston College ↗</a> · <a href="https://smumustangs.com/sports/football/schedule">SMU schedule and results ↗</a></p></details><p class="source-ref">Sources: <a href="https://www.ncaa.com/news/football/article/2026-10-04/top-five-holds-alabama-rises-latest-ap-top-25-college-football-rankings">October 4 AP Top 25 table ↗</a> · <a href="https://www.afca.com/missouri-bounces-back-with-dominant-win/">October 4 US LBM Coaches Poll ↗</a></p></article><article class="card" data-card data-group="ACC" data-status="Unbeaten" id="program-pittsburgh"><span class="rank">25</span><p class="meta">AP No. 25 · Coaches No. 24</p><h3>Pittsburgh</h3><span class="tag">ACC · 5-0</span><p>Pitt reached 5-0 by winning 35-33 at Virginia Tech on Friday. Earlier wins included UCF and Syracuse.</p><dl><dt>Latest result</dt><dd>2026-10-02 · W 35–33 away vs Virginia Tech</dd><dt>AP movement</dt><dd>New</dd><dt>Next game</dt><dd>2026-10-10 · home vs North Carolina</dd></dl><details><summary>New arrival · analysis</summary><p>The first road win strengthened an unbeaten résumé enough to reach the poll. Staying ranked requires turning the entry into a run.</p><p><strong>Watch next:</strong> North Carolina next; a visit to Miami follows Oct. 24.</p><p class="source-ref">Sources: <a href="https://pittsburghpanthers.com/sports/football/stats/2026">Pittsburgh season statistics and results ↗</a> · <a href="https://pittsburghpanthers.com/sports/football?path=football">Pittsburgh current schedule ↗</a></p></details><p class="source-ref">Sources: <a href="https://www.ncaa.com/news/football/article/2026-10-04/top-five-holds-alabama-rises-latest-ap-top-25-college-football-rankings">October 4 AP Top 25 table ↗</a> · <a href="https://www.afca.com/missouri-bounces-back-with-dominant-win/">October 4 US LBM Coaches Poll ↗</a></p></article></div><p class="empty" data-empty hidden>No programs match. Clear the search or reset the filters.</p><noscript><p>All 25 cards are available below without JavaScript. Filters need JavaScript.</p></noscript></section><section id="week"><h2>The next useful comparisons.</h2><div class="grid"><article class="card"><p class="meta">2026-10-09</p><h3>Iowa State at BYU</h3><p>Friday checkpoint for unbeaten BYU</p><p class="source-ref">Sources: <a href="https://byucougars.com/sports/football/schedule">BYU schedule and results ↗</a></p></article><article class="card"><p class="meta">2026-10-10 · 4:30 p.m. PDT</p><h3>Georgia at Alabama</h3><p>Unbeaten SEC contenders meet</p><p class="source-ref">Sources: <a href="https://georgiadogs.com/news/2026/10/5/football-georgia-visits-alabama-for-top-10-matchup">Georgia visits Alabama ↗</a></p></article><article class="card"><p class="meta">2026-10-10 · 12:30 p.m. PDT</p><h3>UCLA at Oregon</h3><p>A stronger test for UCLA; another recovery step for Oregon</p><p class="source-ref">Sources: <a href="https://uclabruins.com/sports/football/schedule">UCLA schedule and results ↗</a> · <a href="https://goducks.com/sports/football/schedule/text">Oregon schedule and results ↗</a></p></article><article class="card"><p class="meta">2026-10-10</p><h3>Indiana at Nebraska</h3><p>Two unbeaten teams before Indiana–Ohio State</p><p class="source-ref">Sources: <a href="https://iuhoosiers.com/news/2026/10/3/football-hoosiers-race-past-rutgers-PETE">Indiana defeats Rutgers ↗</a> · <a href="https://iuhoosiers.com/sports/football/schedule">Indiana schedule ↗</a></p></article><article class="card"><p class="meta">2026-10-10 · 12:30 p.m. PDT</p><h3>Texas vs Oklahoma</h3><p>The poll leader enters Red River</p><p class="source-ref">Sources: <a href="https://texaslonghorns.com/sports/football/schedule/text">Texas 2026 schedule and results ↗</a></p></article></div><p class="note">Kickoff and availability can change. Follow the official schedule links before planning viewing or travel.</p></section><section id="method" class="prose"><h2>A ranking is one kind of evidence.</h2><h3>Ap</h3><p>Media-voted ranking. The program list follows the AP order, reproduced by NCAA.com for the October 4 release.</p><h3>Coaches</h3><p>Separate ranking by participating coaches. A null rank means the team is outside that poll&#x27;s Top 25; the two affected AP teams received votes.</p><h3>Editorial</h3><p>The status labels, season interpretation, why_here and watch_next fields are original editorial analysis based on the linked results. They are not an official explanation of any voter’s ballot.</p><h3>Predictive</h3><p>Predictive ratings estimate future team strength. No dated, current numeric model rating was verified for this edition. Numeric rating fields are intentionally absent.</p><h3>Playoff</h3><p>AP and Coaches positions are not CFP committee rankings or playoff seeds.</p></section><section id="sources"><h2>Read the source record.</h2><p>Sources were checked October 5, 2026. Each card links to the evidence behind its facts; analysis is PointCast editorial interpretation.</p><ol class="sources"><li id="source-ap_oct4"><a href="https://apnews.com/article/college-football-rankings-top-25-7db03c4123afa589863a8b53f4db520c">AP poll report ↗</a><small>Associated Press · 2026-10-04 · Checked October 5, 2026</small></li><li id="source-ap_table"><a href="https://www.ncaa.com/news/football/article/2026-10-04/top-five-holds-alabama-rises-latest-ap-top-25-college-football-rankings">October 4 AP Top 25 table ↗</a><small>NCAA.com · 2026-10-04 · Checked October 5, 2026</small></li><li id="source-coaches_oct4"><a href="https://www.afca.com/missouri-bounces-back-with-dominant-win/">October 4 US LBM Coaches Poll ↗</a><small>AFCA · 2026-10-04 · Checked October 5, 2026</small></li><li id="source-texas_schedule"><a href="https://texaslonghorns.com/sports/football/schedule/text">Texas 2026 schedule and result